// The three words are not three spellings of one thing.
//
//   an act    organises what the play can do, and is the way in
//   a scene   describes where things happen, and holds what is there
//   an actor  is a thing in the play

the Ahk is an act.
this exports Click.        // offered outwards; a host does the clicking

the Knight is an actor.
this can Charge.
this's Charge does...
    log "the knight charges".
    this is ok!

the Battlefield is a scene.
this's Hero is a Knight.   // the scene holds an actor
this can Begin.            // and knows a verb of its own
this's Begin does...
    do Knight's Charge.
    log "the battle begins".
    this is ok!

the App is a script.

do Battlefield's Begin.
